  "notes": "Yamama Cement Company (ticker 3020) audited financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/424_0_2026-02-25...). Auditor: Professional Consultants Company (Abdullah S. Al Msned, License 456); auditor's report Riyadh, 6 Ramadan 1447H / 23 February 2026. The financial statements were approved by the Company's Board of Directors on 16 February 2026. Amounts are presented in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1). The primary statements (printed FS pages 5-8) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. These are the Company's standalone (non-consolidated) statements - Yamama has no subsidiaries (only an equity-method associate), hence no non-controlling interest and no consolidation. There are no discontinued operations - the standard pre-tax - zakat bridge applies. operating_income is the reported 'Income from main activities'. impairment_charges combines 'Provision for expected credit loss (ECL)' and 'Provision for impairment of spare parts for Plants and equipment' (both first appeared in FY2025). finance_costs is 'Finance Cost'; finance_income is 'Investment income'; other_nonoperating_income is 'Gain from sale of property, plant and equipment' (a large SAR 163.6m one-off in FY2025, on land / plant disposals); other_income is the residual 'Other income'. income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Zakat charged for the year'. investments_associates is 'Investments in associates using equity method, Net'; long_term_investments is 'Financial assets at fair value through other comprehensive income'; short_term_investments is 'Financial assets at fair value through profit or loss'. other_reserves combines the 'Statutory reserve', the 'Additional reserve' and the negative 'Cumulative change in fair value of other comprehensive income'. long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current and current portions of 'Long term loans'; lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the non-current / current lease liabilities. provisions is 'Provision for land restoration cost'; defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employees' defined benefits obligations'; related_party_payables is 'Due to related parties'; other_current_liabilities is 'Dividends payable'; accrued_expenses is 'Accrued expenses and other credit balances'; zakat_payable is 'Provision for Zakat'. depreciation_amortization is the single 'Depreciation and amortization' add-back on the cash-flow statement. capex combines 'Purchase of property, plant, and equipment' and 'Additions to capital works in progress' (a heavy plant-upgrade year - SAR 416.0m FY2025 after SAR 983.8m FY2024). zakat_paid is 'Zakat Paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividends paid'. The cash-flow statement does not disclose a separate 'finance cost paid' line, so interest_paid is not carried. The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: financial position 5, profit or loss and OCI 6, changes in equity 7, cash flows 8.",
